// P3.10 / PS1.6, PS20.1: a whole sketch as a Sweep's profile, and a curved face as a Loft's
// profile (P3.10 judge: evidence frames; the values asserted in
// `cadrs_core/tests/part_studio_options.rs`: `sweep_takes_a_whole_sketch_like_its_regions`,
// `loft_from_a_curved_face`).
// 01 PS1.6 the Sweep: Sketch 1 (a Ø10 circle on Top) picked whole in the feature list as the
//    profile (listed "Face of Sketch 1", as an extrude lists a whole sketch; the row in the list
//    shows it picked), a 50 mm vertical line
//    on Front as the path: the Ø10 × 50 rod, π·25·50.
// 02 PS20.1 a half cylinder (R10 × 20 from a half disc on Front, at x = 40, extruded along −Y)
//    and a 20 × 20 square
//    on Plane 1, 30 above Top: the Loft from the cylinder's curved face (a non-planar profile,
//    "Face of Extrude 1") to the square: the block 20·20·30 less the half cylinder's
//    π·100/2·20, 12 000 − 1000π mm³, its bottom the curved face itself; the rod of 01 on the
//    left, clear of the dialog, and Plane 1's square sized to the parts (P3.11; fix round 1:
//    the half cylinder moved in from x = 100 to 40, so the parts, and the plane sized to them
//    as Onshape sizes planes, `ex4-step5.png`, are compact).
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Wait(30),
        Custom("sketch top circle 0 0 5"),
        Wait(5),
        Custom("sketch front chain 0 0 0 50"),
        Wait(5),
        Key("P"),
        Wait(3),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Wait(40),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(40),
        Click(ui("sweep")),
        WaitFor("sweep-dialog"),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("feature-sketch-1")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("sweep-path-field")),
        Wait(3),
        Click(xyz(0, 0, 25)),
        Wait(30),
        ExpectText("sweep-profile-field", "Sketch 1"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-sweep-whole-sketch-profile"),
        Click(ui("sweep-dialog-accept")),
        Wait(20),
        Custom("sketch front circle 40 0 10 chain 30 0 50 0"),
        Wait(5),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(40),
        Key("Shift+E"),
        WaitFor("extrude-dialog"),
        Wait(3),
        Click(xyz(40, 0, 5)),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("extrude-depth-field")),
        Wait(2),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("20"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("plane")),
        WaitFor("plane-dialog"),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("feature-top")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("plane-offset-field")),
        Wait(2),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("30"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("feature-plane-1")),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("sketch")),
        WaitFor("sketch-dialog"),
        Wait(10),
        Key("G"),
        Wait(2),
        ClickWorld(30, -20),
        ClickWorld(50, 0),
        Wait(3),
        Key("Escape"),
        Wait(2),
        Key("Escape"),
        Wait(2),
        Click(ui("sketch-dialog-accept")),
        Wait(10),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Wait(40),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(40),
        Click(ui("loft")),
        WaitFor("loft-dialog"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(xyz(40, -10, 10)),
        Wait(5),
        Click(xyz(40, -10, 30)),
        Wait(30),
        ExpectText("loft-profiles-field", "Face of Extrude 1"),
        // The loft framed with the rod in view (P3.11, P3.10 judge: the rod was clipped behind
        // the dialog).
        Custom("view 45 35.26 22 -10 25 0.1"),
        Wait(40),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-loft-from-a-curved-face"),
    ],
)
